@name!!

That scared them off.  They dropped off the plans here earlier, and I've uploaded them to your blueprints.  Dismantle similar or create components and produce at Nero Primoris Reactor for Deschide Poarta in Arx Emporos (Altair III)

You will need to spend skill points in Build Reactors order to get past this stage.

@name!
Welcome to Arx Emporos.

And to the best place, the bar!

 @name.

I hear you are after a hull upgrade?  You can either pay for a hull upgrade, or go on a special mission for the Progen Republic and gain the hull upgrade while doing it, there also may be other rewards too.  Please note if you are unable to build, the mission may cost you more.

What do you want to do?

@name, no Trouble then?

No, I didn't think so!  And you have my 'Artwork' too.  I'll have to rip that apart later.  Well for your trouble I'll give you a little reward - Trade, Explore and Combat experience.  You deserve it!

I may have some work for you in future, come back to me in future.  The Tiberius Shipyard in Primus is waiting to upgrade your hull.

@name.

You were required only to fix this gate for us.  We are on a highly classified mission, and now you know where we are.  I am therefore aquiring your vessel for a mission.  Please contact me when you arrive on the other side.

MISSION PART SKIPPED, PROCEDE TO GATE FROM 61 CYGNI IN INVERNESS TO CONTINUE WITH MISSION.

@name.

Your prisoner has been secured, and is on route to Detention Centre Onorom.

The special force personel contacted me to state you did them a huge favour.  They are on their way to Nostrand Var to offload security cargo.  Even I don't know whats' in it.

Yes!

@name.
I need a collect a suboptimal genemap from the Onorom Detention Center located in Asteroid Belt Gamma south of Saturn Gamma Navway 5..  Go to Detention Centre Onorom.  Due to the high security, you will have to register with the Gate into Onorom.

